From f9d25f270f04b9a8a93bf18dea4409e945d22fca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nakata Maho <maho.nakata@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 10:55:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add FlagProfile::Upd9002 for the NEC uPD9002 Z80 emulation
 mode

Per-instance flag profile with two values:

  Zilog    default; documented and undocumented Zilog Z80 behaviour
           (the existing behaviour)
  Upd9002  NEC uPD9002 Z80 emulation mode (PC-88VA V1/V2 mode)

Upd9002 applies the rules reproduced from ZEXDOC/ZEXALL on a real
PC-88VA2 in V2 mode:

  R1  F bits 5/3 are never set; POP AF, setAF/setAF2 and reset mask them
  R2  AND: H = 0
  R3  BIT n,r / (HL) / (IX+d) / (IY+d): H = 0
  R4  RLCA/RRCA/RLA/RRA: H and N preserved
  R5  LDI/LDD/LDIR/LDDR: H and N preserved
  R6  ADD HL/IX/IY,rr: H preserved
  R7  ADC/SBC HL,rr: H = carry/borrow out of bit 3

DAA/CPL/SCF/CCF are unresolved and keep Zilog behaviour.
